Package: dev.iosvuln.analyze
Name: iosvuln Analyzer
Version: 0.1.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: iosvuln
Description: Full iosvuln static-analysis engine for on-device use. Runs the complete Python analyzer on the iPhone with a persistent store at /var/mobile/iosvuln (collections, cache, reports, tweaks, logs). Reports vulnerability primitives by assembly address only; no PoC, no exploit. Requires python3 from Sileo; radare2 optional (DEMO fallback otherwise).
Section: Tweaks
Depends: bash, python3
